{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mashup of two classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokogram merges Nonogram logic grids with Sokoban box-pushing puzzles. Instead of coloring in a picture, the Nonogram clues guide you in drawing a path across the grid. Solve puzzles by finding a path that satisfies the clues while allowing every box to reach its goal. Each handcrafted puzzle has a unique solution that can only be found by combining both rulesets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/8735d3c05434470c83b488a70152c510.poster.avif?t=1759239305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/8735d3c05434470c83b488a70152c510.webm?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/8735d3c05434470c83b488a70152c510.mp4?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There might be many paths that fulfill the Nonogram requirements but only one represents a solvable Sokoban puzzle. Once the drawing is complete, every box must be pushed into place to confirm your solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/7727f873b92bd029e32c2d45f7bb15fd.poster.avif?t=1759239305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/7727f873b92bd029e32c2d45f7bb15fd.webm?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/7727f873b92bd029e32c2d45f7bb15fd.mp4?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than just boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later puzzles introduce new mechanics such as rolling snowballs, placeable obstacles like rocks and tree stumps, and quirky creatures like leaping frogs or scaredy bats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/a0e357b837dfd309c06b097633ef3520.poster.avif?t=1759239305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/a0e357b837dfd309c06b097633ef3520.webm?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/a0e357b837dfd309c06b097633ef3520.mp4?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonogram meets Sokoban</strong>\u00a0- Draw a path on a Nonogram grid while planning Sokoban moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intertwined logic</strong>\u00a0- You\u2019re not solving two separate puzzles but one unified challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted puzzles</strong>\u00a0- More than 100 puzzles with unique solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear progression</strong> - Choose puzzles in an overworld that expands as you progress</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054100?t=1759239305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054100?t=1759239305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/d1fd73179c5517e29eca331b06a3573017c383e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759239305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/d1fd73179c5517e29eca331b06a3573017c383e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759239305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mashup of two classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokogram merges Nonogram logic grids with Sokoban box-pushing puzzles. Instead of coloring in a picture, the Nonogram clues guide you in drawing a path across the grid. Solve puzzles by finding a path that satisfies the clues while allowing every box to reach its goal. Each handcrafted puzzle has a unique solution that can only be found by combining both rulesets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/8735d3c05434470c83b488a70152c510.poster.avif?t=1759239305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/8735d3c05434470c83b488a70152c510.webm?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/8735d3c05434470c83b488a70152c510.mp4?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There might be many paths that fulfill the Nonogram requirements but only one represents a solvable Sokoban puzzle. Once the drawing is complete, every box must be pushed into place to confirm your solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/7727f873b92bd029e32c2d45f7bb15fd.poster.avif?t=1759239305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/7727f873b92bd029e32c2d45f7bb15fd.webm?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/7727f873b92bd029e32c2d45f7bb15fd.mp4?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than just boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later puzzles introduce new mechanics such as rolling snowballs, placeable obstacles like rocks and tree stumps, and quirky creatures like leaping frogs or scaredy bats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/a0e357b837dfd309c06b097633ef3520.poster.avif?t=1759239305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/a0e357b837dfd309c06b097633ef3520.webm?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/extras/a0e357b837dfd309c06b097633ef3520.mp4?t=1759239305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonogram meets Sokoban</strong>\u00a0- Draw a path on a Nonogram grid while planning Sokoban moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intertwined logic</strong>\u00a0- You\u2019re not solving two separate puzzles but one unified challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted puzzles</strong>\u00a0- More than 100 puzzles with unique solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear progression</strong> - Choose puzzles in an overworld that expands as you progress</p></li></ul>","developers":["PressGtoGeorge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/bdc7f2b9ae2a0a1ceb2c8c36d75fef48b7828124/header.jpg?t=1759239305","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Sokogram","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If your device runs Windows, then it should run the game.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["PressGtoGeorge"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/ff6cba79ef3ef50ee2487f869256c5738dbabc18/ss_ff6cba79ef3ef50ee2487f869256c5738dbabc18.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759239305","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/ff6cba79ef3ef50ee2487f869256c5738dbabc18/ss_ff6cba79ef3ef50ee2487f869256c5738dbabc18.600x338.jpg?t=1759239305"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054100/1d45d4487b8c2f5512bb23c1f6bc3d6848696a89/ss_1d45d4487b8c2f5512bb23c1f6bc3d6848696a89.1920x1080